                  "mimeType" : "application/javascript",
                  "size" : 10181,
                  "text" : "var MyDropZone = {};\n\nMyDropZone.instances = {};\nMyDropZone.files = [];\nDropzone.autoDiscover = false;\n// MyDropZone.maxFilesize = 4096;\nMyDropZone.maxFilesize = 20000;\nMyDropZone.filesLimit = 100;\n\nMyDropZone.newInstance = function(obj){\n    var instanceAux = {};\n\n    instanceAux.divId = obj.attr(\"id\");\n    instanceAux.ref = obj.attr(\"data-ref\");\n    instanceAux.allow_multi = obj.attr(\"data-allows-multi\");\n    if(instanceAux.allow_multi == 0){\n        instanceAux.allow_multi = false;\n    }else{\n        instanceAux.allow_multi = true;\n    }\n    instanceAux.allow_video = obj.attr(\"data-video\");\n    if(instanceAux.allow_video == 0){\n        instanceAux.allow_video = false;\n    }else{\n        instanceAux.allow_video = true;\n    }\n    instanceAux.files = [];\n\n    instanceAux.start = MyDropZone.start;\n    instanceAux.deleteFromList = MyDropZone.deleteFromList;\n    instanceAux.addToList = MyDropZone.addToList;\n    instanceAux.getFiles = MyDropZone.getFiles;\n    instanceAux.loadFiles = MyDropZone.loadFiles;\n    inst... [truncated to save space (9157 more bytes)]"
